OL,3,GNEWSATeen's 'amazing experience' on The
OL,4,APiano
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Will Renton was six playing the
OL,7,Fpiano was a way to escape his lessons
OL,8,Fat school. Little did he know that 11
OL,9,Fyears later his talent would see him
OL,10,Ffeature on Channel 4's The Piano - and
OL,11,Fgain him host Claudia Winkleman's seal
OL,12,Fof approval.
OL,14,FArriving at Manchester Piccadilly
OL,15,FStation earlier this year, the
OL,16,F17-year-old, from Ripon, took a seat at
OL,17,Fthe upright piano and performed a jazzy
OL,18,Ftune in front of a crowd of commuters.
OL,20,FHe then strode out of the station,
OL,21,Fleaving onlookers wanting more.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
